# Growth mandate (Idle Party)

**Locked 2026-09-12.** Source: `docs/GROWTH_MANDATE.md` (research-checked).

Default work is **grow players**, not AL20 polish. Vague “gör bättre / vad
härnäst” → next **unchecked** box on that done bar. AL20 play notes are a
**quality gate**. They are not the batch.

## Do this

- Time-to-combat **≤90 s** on a new save; first reward in the first session
  (the 15 min line is an envelope, not the hook)
- Funnel events including `app_ready` + `first_reward` + time-to-combat
- One day-2–7 job; punchy Welcome Back
- Notifications after a milestone, ~1–2/day, never install-prompt / combat
- Listing: **icon** + shots 1–2 = live crawl
- Hide dead chrome; gate KEY/endgame until unlock

## Do not do (until the phrase is said)

- New zone / class / God Hand redesign / second sim / gacha / iOS / web product
- AL20 chase/wipe polish as the default slice
- God-object cleanup as the quarter’s story
- Scaled paid UA before D1 is known (tiny spend ≠ a D1 study)

## Phrase

When **every** checkbox in `docs/GROWTH_MANDATE.md` → **Done bar** is `[x]`,
the next user-facing message starts with **exactly**:

`ROBBAN DET BEHÖVS GÖRAS EN NY PLAN FÖR FRAMTIDEN`

Never early. Never paraphrase. `/init` must not restore the old AL20 default.
Why: `docs/LEARNINGS.md`.

